hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1468","Ali bin Saeed and Abu Al-Azhar narrated it, and I wrote it from its origin. They said: We narrated Yunus bin Muhammad, and he is the discipliner. We narrated Falih, and he was Ibn Suleiman, on the authority of Sa`id ibn al-Harith, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: The Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, “when he went out to celebrate the two Eids, he would return on a different route.” in which he came out\""
